Cell["\<\
-5 + 3*\[DoubleStruckE][mvDownUp[{1}, {}], Cl[3, 0, 0]] + \
7*\[DoubleStruckE][mvDownUp[{2}, {}], Cl[3, 0, 0]] - \
\[DoubleStruckE][mvDownUp[{3}, {}], Cl[3, 0, 0]] - \
\[DoubleStruckE][mvDownUp[{1, 2}, {}], Cl[3, 0, 0]] - 
 7*\[DoubleStruckE][mvDownUp[{1, 3}, {}], Cl[3, 0, 0]] + \
9*\[DoubleStruckE][mvDownUp[{2, 3}, {}], Cl[3, 0, 0]] + \
6*\[DoubleStruckE][mvDownUp[{1, 2, 3}, {}], Cl[3, 0, 0]]\
\>", "Output",
